# "bob" IS the lexicalised soft-mutated form of "pob", and it
# is the form the "every X" construction actually uses: "bob dydd" (every
# day) is the entry's own worked example, and "bob dydd Llun" (every Monday)
# is attested in running text on cy.wikipedia.org.  The radical "pob" is
# listed too, for the citation form ("Mae pob dydd yn wahanol").  Sources:
# en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pob and https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bob.
bob
pob
